      "source": [
        "# 🎬 AnimeEncoderBot v2 - Pyrogram MTProto Optimized\n",
        "**GPU-accelerated video encoding on Kaggle T4**\n",
        "\n",
        "✅ **All secrets configured** — Just run all cells!\n",
        "\n",
        "**Performance:**\n",
        "- CPU: 400% → 50-80%\n",
        "- GPU: 5% → 60-85%\n",
        "- Speed: 2-3x faster"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
